t  in so much shock and just so happy  because  those tips were gonna go to her  employees  who aren't making the same amount of  tips  and so they're struggling to pay their  bills she was like hey this  this money is going to help my employee  pay their rent  this month and um being so close to it  it's a very emotional experience to do  diana wow really  i have so much uh admiration  and respect for everything you're doing  when we had heard  about what you had done at  the restaurant you just mentioned  verdura  uh it's funny because i invited julia  here  i can't believe you were talking about  it i i was like  i julia hi  [Music]  thank you so much for having us we  appreciate you  so immensely and everything that you're  doing resonated with us so much and  you know we appreciate it from the  bottom of our hearts thank you diana and  thank you drew  see surprise diana by the way nobody  nobody mess with julia or you're gonna  get it  hello gentlemen thank you for being with  us today  and verdura is um uh  spanish for vegetable and you're a vegan  restaurant  correct yeah so we're 100 vegan um  located in uptown phoenix we've been  through the wringer in terms of hovid  closed three times now and  thank you to diana's generosity for  really showing our staff  how important it means for us to stay in  business and most importantly show them  appreciation  well i just you know our friends at the  uh plant-based company  field roast wanted to join in  on the tipping too because diana has  inspired  all of us including them and we would  love to leave  a five thousand dollar tip at your  restaurant  and  thank you so much well it's so fitting  because field roast  is a plant-based meat and cheese company  who's committed to bringing bold flavor  to your plates at home and restaurants  across the country  and diana how you're able to raise these  funds and the way you're giving them  you're such an inspiration and you  really blew our minds so  thank you for allowing us in on the  party  and um you know thank you to field roast  and diana  and julia and the gentleman don't mess  with julia  and um for more information on how you  can support diana's initiative  i say this with like fingers pointing  because i'm so passionate about it visit  our website please  and um we would love to eat at your  restaurant as soon as it's safe and  possible  we celebrate you julia and diana  and you know gentlemen thank you thank  you so much  for being on the show today
 

